  "title": "PDD Holdings to Report First Quarter 2026 Unaudited Financial Results on May 27, 2026",
  "summary": "DUBLIN and SHANGHAI, May 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PDD Holdings Inc. (“PDD Holdings” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: PDD) today announced that it will report its unaudited financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, before U.S. markets open on Wednesday, May 27, 2026.",
